<title>UK: Single Brent date kept by Shell - trade.</title>
<headline>Single Brent date kept by Shell - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The single Brent cargo which turned wet on Wednesday was kept by the Shell group before the five o' clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>The Brent cargo, originally due to load in the May 7-9 range was deferred and will now load May 8-10, traders said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
